      <div class="steps">
        <div class="step reveal" style="--d:0"><span class="n">01</span><h3>You share your answers</h3><p>Send me your common questions and answers, or I help you write them. They go into a simple Google Sheet you can edit any time.</p></div>
        <div class="step reveal" style="--d:1"><span class="n">02</span><h3>I set it up for you</h3><p>I connect it to your Gmail and your Sheet, set the rules for what must wait for approval, and test it with real emails.</p></div>
        <div class="step reveal" style="--d:2"><span class="n">03</span><h3>You approve what matters</h3><p>Routine emails answer themselves. Anything sensitive waits in your admin panel, one click to approve, edit or reject.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dark" id="demo">
    <div class="sec wrap">
      <div class="dhead">
        <div><p class="eyebrow reveal">See it work</p><h2 class="reveal" style="--d:1">From customer email<br>to <em>approved reply.</em></h2></div>
        <p class="lede reveal" style="--d:2">A short walkthrough of a real email going in, an answer going out, and a refund waiting for approval.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="vframe reveal" id="vframe"></div>

      <div class="shots reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">The admin panel you get</p>
        <h2 style="font-size:clamp(32px,4.4vw,56px)">Know what's waiting. <em>At a glance.</em></h2>
        <div class="stabs" role="tablist"><button role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-shot="0">Overview</button><button role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-shot="1">Review queue</button></div>
        <div class="browser"><div class="bchrome"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>your-admin-panel</span></div>
          <div class="bimg"><img class="on" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Admin panel overview showing emails waiting for review, a ring gauge, and daily charts" width="1280" height="800"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Review queue with a customer email, the AI draft, and an approve button" width="1280" height="800" loading="lazy"></div></div>
        <p class="cap" id="shotCap">Waiting emails, what the AI sent, what you handled, and a downloadable report. The ring grows with every email that needs your eye.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="feats">
        <div class="feat reveal"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="4" y="3.5" width="16" height="17" rx="2.5"/><path d="M4 9h16M9 9v11.5"/></svg><h4>Your answers, your sheet</h4><p>Edit a Google Sheet to change what the agent says. No code, no support ticket.</p></div>
        <div class="feat reveal" style="--d:1"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"/><path d="M12 7.5V12l3 2"/></svg><h4>Approval for risky emails</h4><p>Refunds, discounts, complaints and legal threats are always held for you.</p></div>
